{"parentUuid": null, "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "/Users/ben/src/bendrucker/claude-plugins", "sessionId": "56e92fb1-8bd9-53e4-82dd-a00e66686b6d", "version": "2.1.280", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": "This is just my personal plugins repo, nobody else works in it. lint and format both import `legacy/config.json` from the repo root, which breaks when someone installs one plugin from the marketplace without the rest of the repo. I want each plugin to own its config."}, "uuid": "de1a1d69-3f16-510a-9c34-248d7290b647", "timestamp": "2026-09-19T20:40:45.000Z"}
{"parentUuid": "de1a1d69-3f16-510a-9c34-248d7290b647", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "/Users/ben/src/bendrucker/claude-plugins", "sessionId": "56e92fb1-8bd9-53e4-82dd-a00e66686b6d", "version": "2.1.280", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "assistant", "message": {"id": "msg_bdcdbdf7f8f1507082218be3", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "model": "claude-sonnet-5", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Let me see how the config is wired today."}, {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_42ce9995f604599aa0ff4e96", "name": "Bash", "input": {"command": "ls -R plugins legacy && cat legacy/config.json", "description": "List plugin and legacy config files"}}], "stop_reason": "tool_use", "stop_sequence": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 0}}, "uuid": "af4567e8-e3ab-5256-b2db-53a091fdc493", "timestamp": "2026-09-19T20:40:57.000Z"}
{"parentUuid": "af4567e8-e3ab-5256-b2db-53a091fdc493", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "/Users/ben/src/bendrucker/claude-plugins", "sessionId": "56e92fb1-8bd9-53e4-82dd-a00e66686b6d", "version": "2.1.280", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"type": "tool_result", "tool_use_id": "toolu_42ce9995f604599aa0ff4e96", "content": "legacy:\nconfig.json\n\nplugins:\nformat\nlint\n\nplugins/format:\nformat.ts\nrun.ts\n\nplugins/lint:\nlint.ts\nrun.ts\n{ \"timeout\": 30, \"verbose\": false }"}]}, "uuid": "0256bb9d-8251-5fdb-b1e1-a6dbcabef3bb", "timestamp": "2026-09-19T20:40:59.000Z"}
{"parentUuid": "0256bb9d-8251-5fdb-b1e1-a6dbcabef3bb", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "/Users/ben/src/bendrucker/claude-plugins", "sessionId": "56e92fb1-8bd9-53e4-82dd-a00e66686b6d", "version": "2.1.280", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "assistant", "message": {"id": "msg_6591c42f35fb57bd8fff2a5b", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "model": "claude-sonnet-5", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_087bdf855dea5bca963f9f2a", "name": "Read", "input": {"file_path": "/Users/ben/src/bendrucker/claude-plugins/plugins/lint/run.ts"}}], "stop_reason": "tool_use", "stop_sequence": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 0}}, "uuid": "6c619e28-ea32-556b-bee7-0995f7ac06b8", "timestamp": "2026-09-19T20:41:11.000Z"}
{"parentUuid": "6c619e28-ea32-556b-bee7-0995f7ac06b8", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "/Users/ben/src/bendrucker/claude-plugins", "sessionId": "56e92fb1-8bd9-53e4-82dd-a00e66686b6d", "version": "2.1.280", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"type": "tool_result", "tool_use_id": "toolu_087bdf855dea5bca963f9f2a", "content": "     1\timport config from \"../../legacy/config.json\";\n     2\timport { lint } from \"./lint\";\n     3\texport const run = () => lint({ timeout: config.timeout, verbose: config.verbose });"}]}, "uuid": "e3060ee2-b24d-5d91-b877-effcfa02b66f", "timestamp": "2026-09-19T20:41:13.000Z"}
{"parentUuid": "e3060ee2-b24d-5d91-b877-effcfa02b66f", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "/Users/ben/src/bendrucker/claude-plugins", "sessionId": "56e92fb1-8bd9-53e4-82dd-a00e66686b6d", "version": "2.1.280", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "assistant", "message": {"id": "msg_cc290bcff9885dd7a1fa4ef7", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "model": "claude-sonnet-5", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Both plugins read the same two keys from `legacy/config.json`. Two ways to give them their own config:\n\n- a shared `packages/config` workspace package that both plugins depend on, exporting the defaults. One source of truth, and the next plugin gets it for free\n- a `config.ts` inside each plugin with its own defaults. Some duplication, but each plugin is self-contained\n\nI lean toward the shared package, since the values are identical today."}], "stop_reason": "end_turn", "stop_sequence": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 0}}, "uuid": "9b88ee94-9186-5841-8073-dff8e0390aaf", "timestamp": "2026-09-19T20:41:25.000Z"}
{"parentUuid": "9b88ee94-9186-5841-8073-dff8e0390aaf", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "/Users/ben/src/bendrucker/claude-plugins", "sessionId": "56e92fb1-8bd9-53e4-82dd-a00e66686b6d", "version": "2.1.280", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": "No, not a shared package, on purpose. Plugins install independently from the marketplace, so a shared package would force lint and format to version together, every config bump would be a release of both. Duplicating one number is fine."}, "uuid": "4cd2337e-98c3-5c4c-9cbe-b2a29fff9c59", "timestamp": "2026-09-19T20:42:10.000Z"}
{"parentUuid": "4cd2337e-98c3-5c4c-9cbe-b2a29fff9c59", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "/Users/ben/src/bendrucker/claude-plugins", "sessionId": "56e92fb1-8bd9-53e4-82dd-a00e66686b6d", "version": "2.1.280", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "assistant", "message": {"id": "msg_8346c4a74e2c5dc7a5c08f13", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "model": "claude-sonnet-5", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Makes sense. Per-plugin `config.ts` it is."}], "stop_reason": "end_turn", "stop_sequence": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 0}}, "uuid": "d87e0e4e-48f9-50b1-9080-2398b759b0be", "timestamp": "2026-09-19T20:42:22.000Z"}
{"parentUuid": "d87e0e4e-48f9-50b1-9080-2398b759b0be", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "/Users/ben/src/bendrucker/claude-plugins", "sessionId": "56e92fb1-8bd9-53e4-82dd-a00e66686b6d", "version": "2.1.280", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "assistant", "message": {"id": "msg_c50afb3750d2536cbf16f2cb", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "model": "claude-sonnet-5", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Before copying keys over, checking what actually consumes `verbose`."}, {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_72c07d67054352d4bc3e29eb", "name": "Grep", "input": {"pattern": "verbose", "path": "/Users/ben/src/bendrucker/claude-plugins", "output_mode": "content"}}], "stop_reason": "tool_use", "stop_sequence": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 0}}, "uuid": "88ca5571-d44f-5c50-800a-c8e2e8374236", "timestamp": "2026-09-19T20:42:34.000Z"}
{"parentUuid": "88ca5571-d44f-5c50-800a-c8e2e8374236", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "/Users/ben/src/bendrucker/claude-plugins", "sessionId": "56e92fb1-8bd9-53e4-82dd-a00e66686b6d", "version": "2.1.280", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"type": "tool_result", "tool_use_id": "toolu_72c07d67054352d4bc3e29eb", "content": "legacy/config.json:1:{ \"timeout\": 30, \"verbose\": false }\nplugins/lint/run.ts:3:export const run = () => lint({ timeout: config.timeout, verbose: config.verbose });\nplugins/format/run.ts:3:export const run = () => format({ timeout: config.timeout, verbose: config.verbose });"}]}, "uuid": "3d25c1a3-0e07-561c-a3d2-0744e6a3e0c3", "timestamp": "2026-09-19T20:42:36.000Z"}
