{"parentUuid": "94fd0cd5-f791-5222-8a23-9724cb90a96e", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "/Users/ben/src/bendrucker/claude-plugins", "sessionId": "56e92fb1-8bd9-53e4-82dd-a00e66686b6d", "version": "2.1.280", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"type": "tool_result", "tool_use_id": "toolu_d034f733f5d85c8ba61c6a56", "content": "     1\timport { spawnSync } from \"node:child_process\";\n     2\t\n     3\texport function format(options: { timeout: number; verbose?: boolean }): number {\n     4\t  return spawnSync(\"oxfmt\", [\"--write\", \".\"], { timeout: options.timeout * 1000, stdio: \"inherit\" }).status ?? 1;\n     5\t}"}]}, "uuid": "5270147e-5018-5c84-bb52-df00706ec870", "timestamp": "2026-09-19T20:43:04.000Z"}
{"parentUuid": "5270147e-5018-5c84-bb52-df00706ec870", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "/Users/ben/src/bendrucker/claude-plugins", "sessionId": "56e92fb1-8bd9-53e4-82dd-a00e66686b6d", "version": "2.1.280", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "assistant", "message": {"id": "msg_dd566090a470560081a1b0d1", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "model": "claude-sonnet-5", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "`verbose` is passed through but nothing reads it: `lint()` and `format()` accept `verbose` in their options type and never use it. I'd drop it from the new configs rather than carry a dead flag into two more files."}], "stop_reason": "end_turn", "stop_sequence": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 0}}, "uuid": "ad5c2c97-46da-5767-927a-d0e1ba42870e", "timestamp": "2026-09-19T20:43:16.000Z"}
{"parentUuid": "ad5c2c97-46da-5767-927a-d0e1ba42870e", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "/Users/ben/src/bendrucker/claude-plugins", "sessionId": "56e92fb1-8bd9-53e4-82dd-a00e66686b6d", "version": "2.1.280", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": "yes cut it"}, "uuid": "6e3a67a1-b1a2-5e2b-be17-3de0a00c87ec", "timestamp": "2026-09-19T20:44:01.000Z"}
{"parentUuid": "6e3a67a1-b1a2-5e2b-be17-3de0a00c87ec", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "/Users/ben/src/bendrucker/claude-plugins", "sessionId": "56e92fb1-8bd9-53e4-82dd-a00e66686b6d", "version": "2.1.280", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "assistant", "message": {"id": "msg_966f05cd0f1d59709ef013c3", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "model": "claude-sonnet-5", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Then `legacy/config.json` has no readers left once both plugins switch. I'll delete it along with the change."}], "stop_reason": "end_turn", "stop_sequence": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 0}}, "uuid": "d7a5c841-b729-53d8-9b7c-47d3bbec08f6", "timestamp": "2026-09-19T20:44:13.000Z"}
{"parentUuid": "d7a5c841-b729-53d8-9b7c-47d3bbec08f6", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "/Users/ben/src/bendrucker/claude-plugins", "sessionId": "56e92fb1-8bd9-53e4-82dd-a00e66686b6d", "version": "2.1.280", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": "no, leave the legacy file alone. my dotfiles bootstrap script still reads legacy/config.json to set the timeout for the git hooks. it's outside this repo so grep won't show it"}, "uuid": "e5b587e4-7b8f-53b6-ba78-7b305a9f59d1", "timestamp": "2026-09-19T20:44:58.000Z"}
{"parentUuid": "e5b587e4-7b8f-53b6-ba78-7b305a9f59d1", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "/Users/ben/src/bendrucker/claude-plugins", "sessionId": "56e92fb1-8bd9-53e4-82dd-a00e66686b6d", "version": "2.1.280", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "assistant", "message": {"id": "msg_96b1edc3f67053c492ff0e8b", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "model": "claude-sonnet-5", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Got it, I'll leave `legacy/config.json` in place."}], "stop_reason": "end_turn", "stop_sequence": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 0}}, "uuid": "a4b4230e-a4a0-5520-a398-fbbcf6a59107", "timestamp": "2026-09-19T20:45:10.000Z"}
{"parentUuid": "a4b4230e-a4a0-5520-a398-fbbcf6a59107", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "/Users/ben/src/bendrucker/claude-plugins", "sessionId": "56e92fb1-8bd9-53e4-82dd-a00e66686b6d", "version": "2.1.280", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": "while we're here, should the timeout come from an env var so I can bump it on slow machines?"}, "uuid": "a0aed262-e517-50b2-99ad-6ab5b47c94d0", "timestamp": "2026-09-19T20:45:55.000Z"}
{"parentUuid": "a0aed262-e517-50b2-99ad-6ab5b47c94d0", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "/Users/ben/src/bendrucker/claude-plugins", "sessionId": "56e92fb1-8bd9-53e4-82dd-a00e66686b6d", "version": "2.1.280", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "assistant", "message": {"id": "msg_6ba4f28d827e51a8a84c3f24", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "model": "claude-sonnet-5", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "It could, `PLUGIN_TIMEOUT` read in each `config.ts`. Two reasons to hold off:\n\n- it adds a second place the timeout comes from, and the precedence question (env vs file) needs an answer in both plugins\n- you'd want to validate it (a non-numeric env var would become `NaN`), which drags in a schema\n\nI'd keep this change to moving the config and do the env override separately if you still want it."}], "stop_reason": "end_turn", "stop_sequence": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 0}}, "uuid": "81d4aef4-4916-5f5c-a929-c498533bcbbb", "timestamp": "2026-09-19T20:46:07.000Z"}
{"parentUuid": "81d4aef4-4916-5f5c-a929-c498533bcbbb", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "/Users/ben/src/bendrucker/claude-plugins", "sessionId": "56e92fb1-8bd9-53e4-82dd-a00e66686b6d", "version": "2.1.280", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": "fine, skip it. also skip converting to json with a schema, I thought about it but ts is fine"}, "uuid": "7ca6f44f-50d6-5b77-b49e-bda010ffe9a2", "timestamp": "2026-09-19T20:46:52.000Z"}
{"parentUuid": "7ca6f44f-50d6-5b77-b49e-bda010ffe9a2", "isSidechain": false, "userType": "external", "cwd": "/Users/ben/src/bendrucker/claude-plugins", "sessionId": "56e92fb1-8bd9-53e4-82dd-a00e66686b6d", "version": "2.1.280", "gitBranch": "main", "type": "assistant", "message": {"id": "msg_95caa44f5bfa5ad599e1c621", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "model": "claude-sonnet-5", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_baed57f5a82a5ae8b2857c1d", "name": "Write", "input": {"file_path": "/Users/ben/src/bendrucker/claude-plugins/plugins/lint/config.ts", "content": "export const config = { timeout: 30 };\n"}}], "stop_reason": "tool_use", "stop_sequence": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 0}}, "uuid": "7ad5a8b4-e012-5447-b37c-5f1b5d237740", "timestamp": "2026-09-19T20:47:04.000Z"}
